 "The last equality relies on the fact that ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["h", "0"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "741b431a-bbc8-4fb2-abb3-462bb152cde1"],
 " is a linear operator.  Therefore, we can write:"
}], "Text",
